        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Scarf of printed silk satin with three separate floral patterns. At each end are three broad stripes. The central stripe bear roses on a white ground, and those on either side with a wavy stem with various flowers in purple, orange and yellow. The centre of the scarf has a black ground on which are cone shapes in white and pink linked by smaller flowers. There is a break in the design across the middle of the scarf."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/f163f6a0-516a-3072-a546-69fa4ceedb75> .

